  "description": "As basic as possible Mongol build order for new players. Video below!\n\nThe goal is to be aggressive right from the Dark Age with a tower rush into mass Keshik and Archer. Alternatively, you can start with a fast pasture rather than tower rushing - check out the below video for more detail on the variations.\n\nOn the whole the Mongols have less of a refined build order as the game is a bit more chaotic with the impact of different spawns + dark age aggression. Think of this as more of a guideline for what you're trying to achieve than a strict build! Again, see the video for details.\n\nGood luck!",
